.22 a.m.", "added": false}, {"text": "8.20 a.m.", "added": false}, {"text": "8.26 a.m.", "added": false}, {"text": "8.24 a.m.", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "HCF-LCM", "sub": "application-problems", "key_answer": "8.22 a.m."}, {"n": 6, "text": "In a business with C, A and B invest ₹50,000 and ₹60,000, respectively. The profit of C is double the profit of B. If the total profit is ₹23,000, then the profit of A (in ₹) is:", "options": [{"text": "2,500", "added": false}, {"text": "6,000", "added": false}, {"text": "5,000", "added": false}, {"text": "3,000", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "profit-loss-percent", "key_answer": "5,000"}, {"n": 7, "text": "How many seconds will a boy take to run one complete round around a square field of side 38 metres, if he runs at a speed of 6 km/h?", "options": [{"text": "91.2", "added": false}, {"text": "50.1", "added": false}, {"text": "61.2", "added": false}, {"text": "71.2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": "91.2"}, {"n": 8, "text": "The sum of five numbers is 655. The average of the first two numbers is 78 and the third number is 103. Find the average of the remaining two numbers?", "options": [{"text": "181", "added": false}, {"text": "199", "added": false}, {"text": "198", "added": false}, {"text": "182", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "series-average", "key_answer": "198"}, {"n": 9, "text": "For what value of A, will the expression (13.56 × 13.56 + 13.56 × A + 0.04 × 0.04) be a perfect square?", "options": [{"text": "0.12", "added": false}, {"text": "0.04", "added": false}, {"text": "0.16", "added": false}, {"text": "0.08", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "triangle-and-quadrilaterals", "key_answer": "0.08"}, {"n": 10, "text": "If the least common multiple of 85 and 255 can be expressed as 85R+255, then the value of R is:", "options": [{"text": "10", "added": false}, {"text": "0", "added": false}, {"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "14", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "HCF-LCM", "sub": "hcf-lcm-of-numbers", "key_answer": "0"}, {"n": 11, "text": "The marked price of an item ₹ 25,000. Under a scheme, successive discounts of 10% and 8% are given on it. Find the total discount given while selling the item under the given scheme.", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "mp-sp-relation", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 12, "text": "A sum, when invested at 10% simple interest per annum, amounts to ₹4080 after 2 years. What is the simple interest (in ₹) on the same sum at the same rate of interest in 1 year?", "options": [{"text": "680", "added": false}, {"text": "1360", "added": false}, {"text": "170", "added": false}, {"text": "340", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simple Interest", "sub": "si-formula", "key_answer": "340"}, {"n": 13, "text": "Convert 0.363636 into a fraction.", "options": [{"text": "36/99", "added": false}, {"text": "36/100", "added": false}, {"text": "63/99", "added": false}, {"text": "3636/1000", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "fractions-decimals", "key_answer": "36/99"}, {"n": 14, "text": "A pipe can fill a tank in 9 hours. Another pipe can empty the filled tank in 27 hours. If both the pipes are opened simultaneously, then the time (in hours) in which the tank will be two-third filled, is:", "options": [{"text": "27", "added": false}, {"text": "36", "added": false}, {"text": "18", "added": false}, {"text": "9", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Pipes-Cisterns", "sub": "fill-empty", "key_answer": "9"}, {"n": 15, "text": "A pipe can fill a tank in 6 hours, and another pipe can fill the same tank in 8 hours. If both pipes are opened at the same time, how long (in hours, rounded off to one decimal place) will it take to fill the tank?", "options": [{"text": "5 hours", "added": false}, {"text": "2.5 hours", "added": false}, {"text": "3.4 hours", "added": false}, {"text": "4 hours", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Pipes-Cisterns", "sub": "fill-empty", "key_answer": "3.4 hours"}, {"n": 16, "text": "Jitesh and Kamal can complete a certain piece of work in 18 and 17 days, respectively, They started to work together, and after 5 days, Kamal left. In how many days will Jitesh complete the remaining work?", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "The sum of five numbers is 655. The average of the first two numbers is 75 and the third number is 128. Find the average of the remaining two numbers?", "options": [{"text": "188.5", "added": false}, {"text": "203", "added": false}, {"text": "204", "added": false}, {"text": "189.5", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "series-average", "key_answer": "188.5"}, {"n": 18, "text": "The sum of 8 numbers is 684. Find their average.", "options": [{"text": "83.5", "added": false}, {"text": "86.5", "added": false}, {"text": "85.5", "added": false}, {"text": "84.5", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "simple-average", "key_answer": "85.5"}, {"n": 19, "text": "Evaluate:", "options": [{"text": "7", "added": false}, {"text": "9", "added": false}, {"text": "5", "added": false}, {"text": "6", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "roots", "key_answer": "7"}, {"n": 20, "text": "The population of a town increases by 16% each