": "6 : 7", "added": false}, {"text": "1 : 7", "added": false}, {"text": "7 : 1", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "profit-loss-percent", "key_answer": "6:7"}, {"n": 26, "text": "A man riding on a bicycle at a speed of 93 km/h crosses a bridge in 36 minutes. Find the length of the bridge?", "options": [{"text": "46.9 km", "added": false}, {"text": "50.5 km", "added": false}, {"text": "46.4 km", "added": false}, {"text": "55.8 km", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": "55.8 km"}, {"n": 27, "text": "How many seconds will a boy take to run one complete round around a square field of side 55 metres, if he runs at a speed of 18 km/h?", "options": [{"text": "37", "added": false}, {"text": "47", "added": false}, {"text": "44", "added": false}, {"text": "35", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": "44"}, {"n": 28, "text": "A cuboid has dimensions of length 10 cm, width 5 cm and height 8 cm. A cube with side length 5 cm is cut out from one of the faces of the cuboid. What is the remaining volume of the cuboid?", "options": [{"text": "225 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "200 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "275 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "250 cm3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cube-cuboid", "key_answer": "275 cm 3"}, {"n": 29, "text": "In a race, an athlete covers a distance of 312 m in 104 sec in the first lap. He covers the second lap of the same length in 52 sec. What is the average speed (in m/sec) of the athlete?", "options": [{"text": "10", "added": false}, {"text": "12", "added": false}, {"text": "8", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key